sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Ingestion worker
    participant O as Immutable object store
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Reviewer
    participant API as Spring API
    participant N as Notification worker
    W->>O: Store bytes by SHA256
    W->>DB: Draft with evidence and parser version
    R->>API: Read draft and source evidence
    API-->>R: Current version and fields
    R->>API: Publish corrected fields with expectedVersion
    API->>DB: Transaction lock version and validate evidence
    DB->>DB: Append revision and audit, update catalog, insert outbox
    API-->>R: Published revision or 409 conflict
    N->>DB: Claim outbox work with retry lock
    N->>DB: Insert unique delivery key
    N->>N: Deliver approved recipient digest
    N->>DB: Record result and advance watermark
